      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 997097682,
      "version": 313,
      "versionNonce": 1385533012,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787309262921,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) State Structure (TabState):\n\n    - openTabs: Array of open file IDs per project.\n  \n    - activeTabId: ID of the currently focused tab.\n  \n    - previewTabId: ID of the temporary file in preview mode (italics).  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) State Structure (TabState):\n\n    - openTabs: Array of open file IDs per project.\n  \n    - activeTabId: ID of the currently focused tab.\n  \n    - previewTabId: ID of the temporary file in preview mode (italics).  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YcEvb0xIyNymS4vxy_zty",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 779.3263780723559,
      "y": 1390.2897002806906,
      "width": 880.2392578125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3kG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 800338028,
      "version": 396,
      "versionNonce": 2007023084,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787309556083,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Purpose & Scope:\n\n    - Wraps the Zustand store and automatically binds actions to a specific projectId..\n  \n    - Simplifies component integration by exposing state and clean action handlers directly.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Purpose & Scope:\n\n    - Wraps the Zustand store and automatically binds actions to a specific projectId..\n  \n    - Simplifies component integration by exposing state and clean action handlers directly.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "46rrmei31wlxJcF9tYWNm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 775.9930447390226,
      "y": 1563.2897307982687,
      "width": 662.7796630859375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3kO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1305867628,
      "version": 497,
      "versionNonce": 1595301716,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787309683890,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Exposed State (TabState):\n\n    - openTabs: List of active open file IDs for the current project.\n  \n    - activeTabId: ID of the currently focused tab.\n\n    - previewTabId: ID of the temporary preview file.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Exposed State (TabState):\n\n    - openTabs: List of active open file IDs for the current project.\n  \n    - activeTabId: ID of the currently focused tab.\n\n    - previewTabId: ID of the temporary preview file.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "E5nZ6Jc5RQnUDbfm1dFsw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780.6597927858976,
      "y": 1791.623114994232,
      "width": 779.9994506835938,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3kS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 664150636,
      "version": 599,
      "versionNonce": 1897273964,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787315320764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Optimized Actions (with useCallback):\n\n    - openFile: Triggers opening or previewing a file within the project context.\n  \n    - closeTab: Closes a specific tab file safely using its ID.\n\n    - closeAllTabs: Wipes all open project tabs instantly.\n\n    - setActiveTab: Changes the current active focus tab without altering lists.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Optimized Actions (with useCallback):\n\n    - openFile: Triggers opening or previewing a file within the project context.\n  \n    - closeTab: Closes a specific tab file safely using its ID.\n\n    - closeAllTabs: Wipes all open project tabs instantly.\n\n    - setActiveTab: Changes the current active focus tab without altering lists.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4sAc1k5QWttD75YT5wNeK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 757.3265103151946,
      "y": 2539.956448327565,
      "width": 1328.5390625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3kU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 187869140,
      "version": 718,
      "versionNonce": 901874540,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787315370915,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Design Rationale:\n\n   - Computes paths dynamically instead of storing them as a property, avoiding heavy update costs when renaming parent folders/files.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Design Rationale:\n\n   - Computes paths dynamically instead of storing them as a property, avoiding heavy update costs when renaming parent folders/files.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nApXM0zMtlZvuw8M_xb0l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 752.3264797976165,
      "y": 2671.956489017669,
      "width": 797.4993896484375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3kUV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 469855956,
      "version": 777,
      "versionNonce": 1701938516,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787315424138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Security & Validation:\n\n    - Verifies user authentication, file/project existence, and owner authorization.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Security & Validation:\n\n    - Verifies user authentication, file/project existence, and owner authorization.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cp6NsAo6xiS4A76G1Sioe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 751.659874166106,
      "y": 2797.6231658568618,
      "width": 969.3594360351562,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3kUl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1320094828,
      "version": 896,
      "versionNonce": 2083289812,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787315487703,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Traversal Algorithm (getFilePath):\n\n    - Starts from the target fileId and loops upward using parentId.\n    \n    - Uses path.unshift() to build the path array from root to file, stopping when reaching the top.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Traversal Algorithm (getFilePath):\n\n    - Starts from the target fileId and loops upward using parentId.\n    \n    - Uses path.unshift() to build the path array from root to file, stopping when reaching the top.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ndqwPHOLQ1sHtcUWacVDK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760.6596401980066,
      "y": 358.28955277906255,
      "width": 663.8794555664062,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3kV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1066668780,
      "version": 477,
      "versionNonce": 1379763284,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787309218555,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- Create a store - \"src/features/editor/store/use-editor-store.ts\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- Create a store - \"src/features/editor/store/use-editor-store.ts\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_TKR9CSsCj2ONWg1zMYDk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 759.659721578215,
      "y": 406.62293188876305,
      "width": 605.279541015625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
