      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787309250700,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2- Create a hook - \"src/features/editor/hooks/use-editor.ts\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2- Create a hook - \"src/features/editor/hooks/use-editor.ts\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qYrm-U3v5Jj3K9EkK4GY-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 761.32633483912,
      "y": 818.123015812103,
      "width": 1001.2193603515625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1155648654,
      "version": 371,
      "versionNonce": 1459135444,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787309262921,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Core Data Storage:\n\n    - Uses a Map<ProjectId, TabState> to completely isolate tab states between different projects.  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Core Data Storage:\n\n    - Uses a Map<ProjectId, TabState> to completely isolate tab states between different projects.  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DhM2RhMMjNiD4DGRZyo6s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 761.82633483912,
      "y": 961.3730234414975,
      "width": 1181.19921875,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3lV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 248590482,
      "version": 469,
      "versionNonce": 1499269460,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787309262921,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Key Actions:\n\n    - getTabState: Retrieves project tabs or falls back to defaultTabState if empty.  \n\n    - openFile: Handles single-click (preview/swap mode), double-click (pinned mode), and activating existing tabs.  \n\n    - closeTab: Removes a tab and recalculates the next active tab (handling last-tab, middle-shift, and empty states).  \n\n    - closeAllTabs: Resets the project state back to defaults.  \n\n    - setActiveTab: Updates active focus without altering open or preview lists.  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Key Actions:\n\n    - getTabState: Retrieves project tabs or falls back to defaultTabState if empty.  \n\n    - openFile: Handles single-click (preview/swap mode), double-click (pinned mode), and activating existing tabs.  \n\n    - closeTab: Removes a tab and recalculates the next active tab (handling last-tab, middle-shift, and empty states).  \n\n    - closeAllTabs: Resets the project state back to defaults.  \n\n    - setActiveTab: Updates active focus without altering open or preview lists.  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
