      "text": "3- add code mirror commands to apply the Indentation \"@codemirror/commands\"\n\n    - Integrated core CodeMirror command extensions to support standard keyboard shortcuts, text manipulation, selection handling, \n      line operations out of the box and  auto-formatting rules to keep the codebase clean and aligned with standard formatting guidelines.",
